        "src/tools/attach.ts applyAttachmentArtifacts constructs a journal, records a reverse op after each successful sub-install step (hooks/agents/marker/skills/env), and calls journal.rollback() in its catch block before re-throwing.",
        "Reverse ops delete NEW files created by the step; for steps that MODIFY an existing file, the journal captures the prior content and restores it. Steps that were no-ops (e.g. already-present) record a no-op reverse (or no record).",
